WEBVTT

00:05:58.361 --> 00:06:00.482
I hope there will be many
new job openings.

00:06:00.819 --> 00:06:02.099
And when that time comes,

00:06:02.123 --> 00:06:05.338
I want us all to be ready
to fix the interview process.

00:06:06.098 --> 00:06:09.248
So let's take on the judgment problems
that plague job interviews,

00:06:09.272 --> 00:06:10.831
one at a time.

00:06:13.004 --> 00:06:16.161
DC: When I was trying
to get a corporate job,

00:06:16.185 --> 00:06:20.869
the one thing that was constantly
asked of me is why my grades were so bad

00:06:20.893 --> 00:06:22.805
and why I studied religion.

00:06:22.829 --> 00:06:26.297
And the thing that I continued to say,

00:06:26.321 --> 00:06:28.902
in retrospect, was not the truth.

00:06:29.749 --> 00:06:32.189
I just sort of, I think, lied.